  ## Docker Practical — Full Command List

First, VS Code terminal open panni project folder-kulla po:

```
cd C:\Users\dheiv\OneDrive\Desktop\devopPractice\student-app
```

### 1. Docker installed-ah check pannu

```
docker --version
docker info
```

### 2. Docker image build pannu

Project root-la `Dockerfile` and `.dockerignore` already create pannirukkanum.

```
docker build -t student-app .
```

### 3. Image create aachanu check pannu

```
docker images
```

### 4. Container run pannu

```
docker run -d -p 8081:80 --name student-container student-app
```

### 5. Container running-ah check pannu

```
docker ps
```

All containers status paaka:

```
docker ps -a
```

### 6. Browser-la application open pannu

[http://localhost:8081 — Student Registration App](http://localhost:8081)

### 7. Container logs paaka

```
docker logs student-container
```

Live logs paaka:

```
docker logs -f student-container
```

### 8. Container stop / start pannu

```
docker stop student-container
docker start student-container
```

### 9. Container remove pannu

First stop panni, apram remove pannu.

```
docker stop student-container
docker rm student-container
```

### 10. Docker image remove pannu

```
docker rmi student-app
```

### 11. GitHub-la Dockerfile upload panna

```
git add .
git commit -m "Add Docker configuration"
git push


