| `docker run -d -p 8081:80 --name student-container student-app` | Container create panni run pannum |
| `docker ps`                                                     | Running containers kaattum        |
| `docker ps -a`                                                  | All containers kaattum            |
| `docker logs student-container`                                 | Container logs kaattum            |
| `docker stop student-container`                                 | Container stop pannum             |
| `docker start student-container`                                | Container restart pannum          |
| `docker rm student-container`                                   | Container remove pannum           |
| `docker rmi student-app`                                        | Image remove pannum
